<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37028" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pontus</span></b> , i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>the sea</i> (<b>poet.</b> for mare): mulserat huc navem pontus,
			Enn. ap. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 870</span></i> P. (Ann. v. 257
			Vahl.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">placidus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					2, 559</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pontus Libyae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 556</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caelum undique et undique pontus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 193</span></i>
			 al.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aequora ponti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr. 1,
					8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">2, 772</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Verg.
				G. 1, 469</span></i>; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">freta ponti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 1, 356</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Poet.</b>, transf. * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The deep</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">maris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 377</span></i>
			 (a poetic pleonasm, like the Homer. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόντος ἁλὸς πολιῆς</span>, Il. 21,
			59).—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A wave of the sea</i>, <i>sea-wave</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ingens a vertice pontus In puppim ferit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 114</span></i>
			.</div>
